   "briefTitle": "Tiotropium (Spiriva) Rehabilitation Study",
   "officialTitle": "A Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo Controlled 25-week Trial to Compare the Effect of Tiotropium Inhalation Capsuled (18 Mcg) Once Daily on Exercise Tolerance in Patients With Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD) Participating in 8 Weeks of Pulmonary Rehabilitation."
  },
